4. Activation and your data

   Activation: to use the Software it must be activated online once per device. Activation sends the
   author's activation service an anonymous identifier of your device (a one-way hash, not the device's
   real serial numbers), the app version, the name of your operating system and a random installation
   number. The licence you receive is bound to that device and is renewed automatically from time to time;
   it keeps working offline until it expires. The author may refuse or withdraw a licence that is being
   misused (for example shared between devices or obtained by tampering).

   The pieces, recordings, settings and other files you create or import stay yours. The Software only
   reads and writes them on your device. Other features that connect to the internet (checking for
   updates, downloading soundfonts or scores you ask for, optional crash reports and usage statistics)
   are described in the app; the optional ones are off until you switch them on. Personal data is
   processed in line with the UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 on the Protection of Personal Data
   and the privacy notice shown in the app. You are responsible for having the right to use any music,
   scores or soundfonts you load into the Software.

